<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 221,920.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 221,920.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of April 11 totaled 221,920 bales, up from 221,917 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were three bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 569 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
